  "body": "In the new text at https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/, abstract operations have been properly extracted, including the creation of e.g. readable stream enqueue functions. The reference implementation should be updated to reflect this, by pulling those functions out instead of having them be underscore-prefixed methods on the stream.\n\nThis should be done at a point when all the other PRs are settled so as to avoid conflicts.\n",
